178	    /**
179	     * Derive the owner's age band from its birthDate against the registrationDate: 'MINOR' when
180	     * under 18, 'ADULT' from 18 to 64, and 'SENIOR' at 65 or older. The age is the number of whole
181	     * years between birthDate and registrationDate (falling back to the current date when the owner
182	     * has no registrationDate). Returns null when the owner or its birthDate is absent, so no
183	     * ageBand is reported.
184	     */
